                           $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}T}{\\text{d}{t}^{2}}\\,=\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}" 13194139534565 true] [17592186295775 1113 #uuid "fe1d1c42-7578-502a-a670-1cf49da1604c" 13194139534565 true] [17592186295775 1145 "To find an expression for the second derivative, we differentiate the equation with respect to $t,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-0.03(T-25)) \\\\ \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}T}{\\text{d}{t}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-0.03T+0.75) \\\\  & =-0.03\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(T)+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(0.75) \\\\  & =-0.03\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute the given expression for $\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}$ into the above and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}T}{\\text{d}{t}^{2}} & =-0.03\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =-0.03(-0.03(T-25)) \\\\  & =0.0009(T-25)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534565 true] [17592186295776 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295777 13194139534565 true] [17592186295776 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534565 true] [17592186295776 1041 "field-1" 13194139534565 true] [17592186295776 1104 #edb/ref 17592186295777 13194139534565 true] [17592186295776 1110 #uuid "15a79c3a-8df9-5d7c-a21a-9495114d04ec" 13194139534565 true] [17592186295777 1034 "0.0009(T-25)" 13194139534565 true] [17592186295777 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534565 true] [17592186295777 1111 #uuid "42138c40-d848-58e8-b042-ac104e97663d" 13194139534565 true] [17592186295778 1017 #edb/ref 17592186295779 13194139534565 true] [17592186295778 1089 "q-168077" 13194139534565 true] [17592186295778 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534565 true] [17592186295778 1100 "Let $T(t)$ represent the temperature of an object at t